name: ['Allied Strategies', 'Armadillo Cloak', 'Bone Shredder', 'Carrion Feeder', 'Charging Troll', 'Coalition Relic', "Darigaaz's Charm", 'Darigaaz, the Igniter', 'Dark Ritual', 'Elfhame Palace', 'Evasive Action', 'Exotic Curse', 'Fertile Ground', 'Forest', 'Gerrard Capashen', "Gerrard's Command", 'Harrow', 'Hideous End', 'Hornet Cannon', 'Island', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Living Death', 'Mountain', 'Narrow Escape', 'Nomadic Elf', 'Order of Yawgmoth', 'Phyrexian Arena', 'Phyrexian Battleflies', 'Phyrexian Broodlings', 'Phyrexian Colossus', 'Phyrexian Debaser', 'Phyrexian Defiler', 'Phyrexian Denouncer', 'Phyrexian Gargantua', 'Phyrexian Ghoul', 'Phyrexian Hulk', 'Phyrexian Negator', 'Phyrexian Plaguelord', 'Phyrexian Processor', 'Phyrexian Totem', 'Phyrexian Vault', 'Plains', 'Power Armor', 'Priest of Gix', 'Puppet Strings', 'Quirion Elves', "Rith's Charm", 'Rith, the Awakener', 'Sanguine Guard', 'Shivan Oasis', 'Slay', 'Sunscape Battlemage', 'Swamp', 'Tendrils of Corruption', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Thornscape Apprentice', 'Thornscape Battlemage', 'Thunderscape Battlemage', "Treva's Charm", 'Treva, the Renewer', 'Tribal Flames', "Urza's Rage", 'Verduran Emissary', 'Voltaic Key', 'Whispersilk Cloak', 'Worn Powerstone', 'Yavimaya Elder']
