text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'As Phyrexian Processor enters the battlefield, pay any amount of life.\\n{4}, {T}: Create an X/X black Phyrexian Minion creature token, where X is the life paid as Phyrexian Processor entered the battlefield.', 'As Quirion Elves enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 1 life for each card in target opponent's hand.\\n{3}{W}: Tap target creature. Activate only if Gerrard Capashen is attacking.", "Carrion Feeder can't block.\\nSacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Carrion Feeder.", 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Exile target attacking creature.\\n• Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target nonbasic land.\\n• Create three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.\\n• Prevent all damage a source of your choice would deal this turn.', "Choose one —\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n• Darigaaz's Charm deals 3 damage to any target.\\n• Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.", "Destroy target green creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Domain — Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target player draws a card for each basic land type among lands they control.', 'Domain — Tribal Flames deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — {3}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Each player exiles all creature cards from their graveyard, then sacrifices all creatures they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield.', 'Elfhame Palace enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Enchant creature\\nDomain — Enchanted creature gets -1/-1 for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has trample.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', "Equipped creature can't be blocked and has shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nEquip {2}", "Equipped creature has haste and shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nEquip {0}", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhenever Order of Yawgmoth deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.", 'First strike\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Sanguine Guard.', 'Flying\\nEcho {2}{B} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Bone Shredder enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Darigaaz, the Igniter deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, choose a color, then that player reveals their hand and Darigaaz deals damage to the player equal to the number of cards of that color revealed this way.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Rith, the Awakener deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{G}. If you do, choose a color, then create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each permanent of that color.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Treva, the Renewer deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{W}. If you do, choose a color, then you gain 1 life for each permanent of that color.', 'Flying\\n{B}: Phyrexian Battleflies gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than twice each turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Debaser: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Kicker {1}{B} and/or {G} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} and/or {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Thunderscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {1}{B} kicker, target player discards two cards.\\nWhen Thunderscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {G} kicker, destroy target enchantment.', 'Kicker {1}{G} and/or {2}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} and/or {2}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Sunscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {1}{G} kicker, destroy target creature with flying.\\nWhen Sunscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {2}{U} kicker, draw two cards.', "Kicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Verduran Emissary enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, destroy target artifact. It can't be regenerated.", "Kicker {8}{R} (You may pay an additional {8}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nThis spell can't be countered.\\nUrza's Rage deals 3 damage to any target. If this spell was kicked, instead it deals 10 damage to that permanent or player and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Kicker {R} and/or {W} (You may pay an additional {R} and/or {W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {R} kicker, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {W} kicker, destroy target artifact.', "Phyrexian Colossus doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nPay 8 life: Untap Phyrexian Colossus.\\nPhyrexian Colossus can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.", "Return target permanent you control to its owner's hand. You gain 4 life.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Phyrexian Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Shivan Oasis enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Tendrils of Corruption deals X damage to target creature and you gain X life, where X is the number of Swamps you control.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Phyrexian Negator is dealt damage, sacrifice that many permanents.', 'Untap target creature. It gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\n{G}: Regenerate Charging Troll.', 'When Phyrexian Gargantua enters the battlefield, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'When Priest of Gix enters the battlefield, add {B}{B}{B}.', 'When Yavimaya Elder dies, you may search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Elder: Draw a card.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Phyrexian Broodlings.', '{1}, {T}: Untap target artifact.', '{1}{G}: Add one mana of any color.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{2}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', '{3}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Insect artifact creature token with flying and haste named Hornet. Destroy it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{R}, {T}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.\\n{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Defiler: Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Denouncer: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{T}: Put a charge counter on Coalition Relic.\\nAt the beginning of your precombat main phase, remove all charge counters from Coalition Relic. Add one mana of any color for each charge counter removed this way.', "{T}: Add {B}.\\n{2}{B}: Phyrexian Totem becomes a 5/5 black Phyrexian Horror artifact creature with trample until end of turn.\\nWhenever Phyrexian Totem is dealt damage, if it's a creature, sacrifice that many permanents."]
flavor: ['"Don\'t laugh. It works."', '"Father of Machines! Your filigree gaze carves us, and the scars dance upon our grateful flesh."\\n—*Phyrexian Scriptures*', '"Fire is the universal language."\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"From void evolved Phyrexia. Great Yawgmoth, Father of Machines, saw its perfection. Thus the Grand Evolution began."\\n—*Phyrexian Scriptures*', '"Gix doesn\'t want a people to rule but puppets to entertain his madness."\\n—Xantcha, Phyrexian outcast', '"Great peril demands formidable weaponry."\\n—Urza', '"Have no illusions," Volrath warned Greven, "about free will."', '"I\'ve journeyed across Dominaria. Phyrexians are everywhere. Plague is everywhere. There\'s no place left to hide."', '"The final stage of the illness: delirium, convulsions, and death."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The first stage of the illness: rash and nausea."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The second stage of the illness: high fever and severe infectiousness."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The secrets of Phyrexia are expensive. You will pay in brass and bone, steel and sinew."\\n—Kaervek', '"The third stage of the illness: muscle aches and persistent cough."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"Unless you like the idea of becoming some goblin\'s lunch, get up and move!"', 'After encountering them, Squee finally lost his appetite for bugs.', 'After lightning struck the cliffs, the ore became iron, the iron became steel, and the steel became greaves. The lightning never left.', 'An audience of one with the malice of thousands.', 'As Phyrexians descended, Multani paused to reflect on the beauty that might never be seen again.', "Darkness doesn't always send its minions to do its dirty work.", 'Death is a generous author, always willing to grant a stirring final chapter.', 'Each commander looked at the others and wondered who would be first to break the alliance.', 'Effective use of terrain is a lesson good commanders learn quickly.', 'Even a fragment of a powerstone contains within it not just energy, but space—vast dimensions trapped in fragile crystal.', "Fouler than a necromancer's kiss.\\n—Jamuraan expression", 'He could find no strength left to budge, no power left to fight, no will left to live. Luckily, they could find him.', "It doesn't think. It doesn't feel.\\nIt doesn't laugh or cry.\\nAll it does from dusk till dawn\\nIs make the soldiers die.\\n—Onean children's rhyme", 'Llanowar has seven elfhames, or kingdoms, each with its own ruler. Their palaces are objects of awe, wonder, and envy.', 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', 'Only the hardiest explorers survive to eat the fruit.', 'Other Phyrexians have nightmares about the gargantua.', 'Phyrexia wastes nothing. Its food chain is a spiraling cycle.', 'Stinking of rot, it leaps between gravestones in search of its next meal.', 'Such cloaks are in high demand both by assassins and by those who fear them.', 'The elves had the edge in guile, skill, and valor. But in the end, only sheer numbers mattered.', 'The key did not work on a single lock, yet it opened many doors.', 'They exist to cease.', 'They stop for nothing, not even the end of a battle.', 'With limited resources and near unlimited time, Kerrick used parts from one beast to build another.']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Alton Lawson', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brian Despain', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Charles Gillespie', 'Chippy', 'Ciruelo', 'D. J. Cleland-Hura', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Dorman', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Martin', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Hannibal King', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jerry Tiritilli', 'Jim Murray', 'John Avon', 'John Zeleznik', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Mike Ploog', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Rob Alexander', 'Roger Raupp', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott Bailey', 'Scott Kirschner', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Tom Fleming', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
